    "fn pay_alias(ib mut* p, ib mut* q) void { p->n = 1; q->n = 2; i32 a = p->n;",
    "    i32 mut* own k = new(i32); }",
    "fn pay_own(ib mut* p, ib mut* q) void { p->n = 1; i32 a = p->n; q->n = 2;",
